# TaskHub

TaskHub is a task management application built with Next.js.

## Overview

TaskHub allows authenticated users to organize work using boards and tasks.  
Each board contains a list of tasks that can be created, deleted, and marked as completed.

The project is designed as a full-stack Next.js application with API routes, authentication, css with Tailwind, MongoDB database and testing with Playwright.

## Technology Stack

- Next.js 16
- React 19
- TypeScript
- NextAuth
- MongoDB
- Mongoose
- bcryptjs
- Tailwind CSS
- ESLint
- Playwright

## Running the Application

npm run dev

The application will be available at: http://localhost:3000

### Testing

To run test create test user:
    test@mail.com
    asd
then
npx playwright test
